{
  "_about": "The zones of the route, in order. A built zone has a scene (palette names for its sky, fog, light, unlit windows and ink, and where its fog starts and is full), a route, archetypes, names and encounters; a sealed zone only its name, year and boss. A run's graph is made from a zone's route by a seeded roll (crates/core/src/route.rs): the main path is arrival, main_fights fights, the rest and the boss; between main fights, detours of 1 to detour_max nodes rejoin the next main node, and a detour's last node holds a reward drawn from rewards. Encounters are listed by tier; a main fight's tier is in main_tiers, a detour's is one higher. clemency is what the court grants per node cleared. rest_rewards: the rest node offers one of these beside its fountain, and you take one or the other. cache_rewards: the arrival offers two of these, and you take one (none when empty).",
